<title>ITALY: SOCCER-PIACENZA BEAT CAGLIARI 3-1 TO STAY IN SERIE A.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PIACENZA BEAT CAGLIARI 3-1 TO STAY IN SERIE A.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piacenza beat Cagliari 3-1 (halftime 2-0) in an Italian serie A soccer league relegation play-off in Naples on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Piacenza - Pasquale Luiso 7, 90, Daniele Berretta own goal 41</p>
<p>Cagliari - Sandro Tovalieri 65</p>
<p>Cagliari are relegated to serie B.</p>
</text>
